# SNI candidates for REALITY fitness testing.
# Format: one hostname per line. Comments (#) and blank lines are ignored.
# Test with: ngray sni test   /   ngray sni discover
#
# Good REALITY SNI: TLS1.3 + h2 ALPN + X25519 + non-redirect + IP near VPS.
#
# Protocol-specific notes:
#   REALITY+Vision  — any OK SNI; prefer IP near VPS (use `ngray sni test`)
#   XHTTP           — prefer Cloudflare/Fastly CDN (no rate-limiting on chunked streams):
#                     pypi.org, files.pythonhosted.org, jsdelivr.net, npmjs.com, jquery.com
#                     Avoid Google (rate-limits unusual HTTP/2 patterns aggressively)
#   AnyTLS          — any OK SNI; padding obfuscation is protocol-level, SNI choice matters less
#   TUIC/Hysteria2  — SNI is for self-signed cert only; IP routing, not nginx; any OK SNI fine

# ── Tech / developer (widely whitelisted by Iranian carriers) ──────────────
fastly.com
pypi.org
files.pythonhosted.org
docs.python.org
python.org
rust-lang.org
www.rust-lang.org
crates.io
pkg.go.dev
golang.org
nodejs.org
npmjs.com
registry.npmjs.org
jquery.com
react.dev
rubygems.org
kotlinlang.org
gradle.org
jetbrains.com

